    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">National Auto Parts Distributor • Guadalajara, Mexico</p>
  </button>

  <div x-show="open" x-transition class="overflow-hidden mt-2">
    <ul class="space-y-1">
      <template x-for="(item, index) in [
        'Led IT operations for the Western region of a nationwide auto parts distributor, managing infrastructure across multiple branches.',
        'Maintained Linux-based environments (Slackware) for servers and workstations, including hardware provisioning and OS installations.',
        'Managed user support, access control, and Samba-based file sharing across all regional offices.',
        'Implemented Squid proxy rules and firewall configurations to control web access and protect internal networks.',
        'Monitored and maintained VPN connectivity between regional branches and headquarters in Culiacán.',
        'Provided remote and on-site support for connectivity, system issues, and hardware replacements.',
        'Coordinated vendor relationships and handled procurement and infrastructure upgrades for all branches in the region.'
      ]" :key="index">
        <li class="list-item-fade list-disc list-inside text-gray-400 text-base"
            :style="'animation-delay: ' + (index * 100) + 'ms'">
          <span x-text="item"></span>
        </li>
      </template>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>



 <div x-data="{ open: false }" class="relative ml-4 animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-300">
  <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-green-400 rounded-full -left-6 top-2 border-2 border-black"></div>

  <button @click="open = !open" class="text-left w-full group focus:outline-none">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-100 group-hover:text-accent transition">
      Linux Systems Engineer
    </h3>
    <time class="block mb-1 text-sm text-gray-500">2011 – 2013</time>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">Jalisco • Animation Studios</p>
  </button>

  <div x-show="open" x-transition class="overflow-hidden mt-2">
    <ul class="space-y-1">
      <template x-for="(item, index) in [
        'Provided Linux-based infrastructure support for animation and rendering pipelines in production environments.',
        'Installed and configured services for internal file sharing, job queuing, and collaborative workflows.',
        'Administered the rendering server queue, ensuring optimal utilization and troubleshooting failed jobs.',
        'Built and deployed render farms using Maya and Blender; set up headless nodes for cluster-based workloads.',
        'Installed and configured drawing tablets, proprietary drivers, and Wacom devices on Linux workstations.',
        'Deployed and managed Xen-based virtualization, including network bridges, guest configuration, and access control.',
        'Maintained and supported remote and on-site servers across multiple departments and animation teams.'
      ]" :key="index">
        <li class="list-item-fade list-disc list-inside text-gray-400 text-base"
            :style="'animation-delay: ' + (index * 100) + 'ms'">
          <span x-text="item"></span>
        </li>
      </template>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>


<div x-data="{ open: false }" class="relative ml-4 animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-300">
  <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-green-400 rounded-full -left-6 top-2 border-2 border-black"></div>

  <button @click="open = !open" class="text-left w-full group focus:outline-none">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-100 group-hover:text-accent transition">
      Independent IT Consultant & Small Business Owner
    </h3>
    <time class="block mb-1 text-sm text-gray-500">2007 – 2011</time>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">Mexico • Government & Education Clients</p>
  </button>

  <div x-show="open" x-transition class="overflow-hidden mt-2">
    <ul class="space-y-1">
      <template x-for="(item, index) in [
        'Founded and operated a small IT services business, delivering full-stack technical support and consulting.',
        'Led structured cabling and LAN deployment projects for universities and municipal government offices.',
        'Managed end-to-end procurement, installation, and configuration of servers, switches, routers, and firewalls.',
        'Oversaw bidding and execution of government contracts, ensuring timely delivery and compliance.',
        'Provided on-site support for desktops, printers, and networking hardware in high-demand environments.',
        'Sold and configured computer systems, peripherals, and office technology solutions for SMB clients.',
        'Deployed VPN solutions and internal file-sharing infrastructure tailored to client needs.'
      ]" :key="index">
        <li class="list-item-fade list-disc list-inside text-gray-400 text-base"
            :style="'animation-delay: ' + (index * 100) + 'ms'">
          <span x-text="item"></span>
        </li>
      </template>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>


 <div x-data="{ open: false }" class="relative ml-4 animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-300">
  <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-green-400 rounded-full -left-6 top-2 border-2 border-black"></div>

  <button @click="open = !open" class="text-left w-full group focus:outline-none">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-100 group-hover:text-accent transition">
      IT Support Technician
    </h3>
    <time class="block mb-1 text-sm text-gray-500">2003 – 2007</time>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">On-site • Small Business • Jalisco</p>
  </button>

  <div x-show="open" x-transition class="overflow-hidden mt-2">
    <ul class="space-y-1">
      <template x-for="(item, index) in [
        'Provided on-site IT support for small and mid-sized businesses, troubleshooting hardware and network issues.',
        'Assembled and configured desktop PCs, installed operating systems, and performed routine maintenance tasks.',
        'Deployed and maintained local area networks (LAN), including cabling, shared folders, and network printers.',
        'Managed user access and desktop policies via Active Directory and Group Policy Objects (GPO).',
        'Installed and updated antivirus solutions; educated end-users on basic cybersecurity hygiene.',
        'Handled system reinstalls, data backups, and peripheral setup for printers, scanners, and routers.'
      ]" :key="index">
        <li class="list-item-fade list-disc list-inside text-gray-400 text-base"
            :style="'animation-delay: ' + (index * 100) + 'ms'">
